    schema:description "Deine Mission As a full-time member of our Orbital Systems team in Munich/Germany, you will work on defining the architecture of fluidic systems for spacecraft propulsion and other functions, working closely with a multi-disciplinary team. We work on projects ranging from launcher propulsion systems to orbital refuelling systems. Your role will include: Defining fluidic systems' architectures, working closely with other domain architects Performing fluidic systems' simulations (performance calculations, steady and transient CFD, thermal and others) Systems Engineering, incl. Requirements Engineering and MBSE Technical leadership Driving MAIT, incl. hands-on support Co-ordinating design and mechanical engineers Direct interfacing with customers and suppliers Supporting proposal preparation Dein Profil We are seeking engineers with demonstrated expertise in fluidic systems. Candidates with 3+ years of relevant experience are encouraged to apply. We are also interested in more experienced professionals with 10+ years of experience in fluidic system architecture and leadership. The position level, scope, and compensation will be determined based on the candidate's experience and demonstrated impact. Ideally, your experience includes: Knowledge of space systems and subsystems Propulsion systems architecture, including HTP and/or hydrazine/MMH Propellants ground handling experience including safety requirements Fluidic system simulations, with knowledge of ECOSIM / ESPSS, Simulink, Matlab Familiarity with MBSE concepts and requirements engineering principles; ECSS Strong analytical and communication skills Hands-on mindset for hardware related activities Proactive, structured, and able to work independently and in a team Wir bieten Immediate and flexible start Permanent full-time position (40 h/week) Attractive salary 30 days annual vacation and flexible working hours Bike leasing, Jobticket and EGYM Wellpass Complimentary beverages, company events, and professional development opportunities Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
