            schema:name "London - The River Building HQ" ] ;
    schema:title "Head EMEA Refund Fraud, Integrity - Fixed Term Contract" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/deliveroo/head-emea-refund-fraud-integrity-fixed-term-contract-london-223086> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-head-of-finance-and-operations-berlin-327630> a prov:Entity,
