    schema:description "Help shape the future of an internationally oriented SAP landscape and actively drive the transformation to SAP S/4HANA. As SAP Lead (m/f/d) Competence Centre, you will take responsibility for strategic SAP projects, further develop a high-performing Competence Centre and combine technological innovation with the requirements of a dynamic business. Do you know someone who fits this job description? Then claim our referral bonus now! Please feel free to contact me by telephone on 089 9982966 47. Aufgaben Managing the S/4HANA transformation from SAP ECC across multiple companies and ensuring a successful cloud migration Leading and developing the SAP Competence Centre, as well as building a motivated team with a strong willingness to embrace change and innovation Developing and optimising the SAP landscape to support business growth, new markets and innovative products Taking responsibility for the integration of SAP with relevant upstream and downstream systems, as well as the continuous improvement of interfaces and processes Identifying opportunities for the automation and standardisation of SAP processes and utilising modern S/4HANA functionalities Qualifikation Several years’ experience in the SAP environment, particularly with S/4HANA and the FI/CO modules A successfully completed degree in Computer Science, Business Informatics, Business Administration or a comparable qualification Experience in the technical and managerial leadership of teams, as well as in the management of complex IT transformation projects Confident manner and strong communication skills when dealing with business units, management and C-level stakeholders A structured and entrepreneurial mindset, strong problem-solving skills and a very good command of English; German proficiency would be beneficial Benefits Hybrid working, flexible working hours and 30 days’ annual leave Attractive discounts and special rates for transport, travel, technology and other lifestyle offers Support with personal mobility, including a company car Company pension scheme and capital-forming benefits A modern corporate culture with fitness facilities, a staff canteen and a wide range of leisure activities, as well as an additional volunteer day per year A referral bonus of €1,000 Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
