    schema:description "Help shape the SAP architecture of an internationally successful company and develop innovative solutions for complex finance and business processes. As an Solution Architect (m/f/d) SAP Finance, you will drive the S/4HANA transformation, combine modern cloud and SAP technologies, and create future-proof solutions for a growing international environment. Do you know someone who fits this job description? Then claim our referral bonus now! Please feel free to contact me by telephone on 089 9982966 47. Aufgaben Designing and further developing a future-proof SAP system architecture for international finance and business processes Supporting the S/4HANA transformation and the technical design of the SAP landscape, with a focus on Finance, Controlling and SD Analysing business requirements and developing suitable SAP solution architectures in close collaboration with Accounting, Tax and Controlling Managing collaboration between SAP and software development teams, and defining architecture and development standards Designing modern integration solutions between SAP, cloud platforms, APIs and microservices, and ensuring stable system operations Qualifikation Several years’ professional experience in SAP architecture and solution development, as well as a strong understanding of complex enterprise systems In-depth knowledge of SAP S/4HANA Finance, FI/CO and SD, as well as experience with SAP R/3 to S/4HANA migrations Practical knowledge of SAP integration, particularly with PI/PO, CPI and APIs, and ideally experience with SAP Private Cloud Good knowledge of data architectures, data warehousing, analytics and real-time processing A strong communicator with a structured approach to work and the ability to clearly link technical solutions to business requirements Benefits A hybrid working model, flexible working hours and 30 days’ annual leave Attractive staff discounts A monthly transport allowance of €20, as well as other support for personal mobility Company pension scheme and capital-forming benefits Modern working environment with a gym, staff canteen and leisure facilities, as well as an extra day off for voluntary work Referral bonus of €1,000 Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
