    schema:datePosted "2026-08-21"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "🚀 Why Midnite? Midnite is a next-generation sports betting and gaming platform built for a new wave of players. We combine sharp product thinking, bold brand, and fast execution to create experiences that feel modern, intuitive, and built for how people actually play today. Over 400,000 players have already made the move, and we’re only just getting started. We’re a high-performance team operating at pace. High ownership. Constant iteration. No hiding behind processes. We move quickly, test relentlessly, and turn ambitious ideas into real impact. If you’re driven, creative, and thrive in fast-moving environments where you can shape meaningful outcomes - keep reading. Not your grandad’s bookie. 👀 The Role Title: Sports Trader Team: Trading Location: Gibraltar, on-site We’re looking for an experienced Sports / Risk Trader who knows there’s a lot more to trading than moving a price and watching the liability screen. You’ll join Midnite’s growing trading team, helping us manage risk across a wide range of sports. That means profiling customers, managing events and limits, pricing markets and making good calls when the action starts coming in. You’ll need strong sporting knowledge, sound judgement and at least three years’ experience in a sports trading or risk role. We’re growing quickly, so we’re after someone who knows their stuff but still wants to learn, improve and help us do things better. Hours of work: Monday - Sunday (8am-12pm) 5/7 days. You will: Profile customers and manage risk based on betting behaviour. Manage sporting events from a risk perspective, including liabilities and limits. Set and manage prices across a range of sports. Price specials and unique betting markets. Handle trading-related customer queries accurately and efficiently. Work closely with our trading suppliers to keep things running as they should. Collaborate with the wider team to plan and promote trading products. Get stuck into all aspects of trading operations as we continue to grow. The next Midniter: Will have at least 3 years’ experience working as a Sports / Risk Trader, including profiling customers. Will have experience managing sporting events from a risk perspective. Will have experience managing limits on events. Will have experience managing prices across a variety of sports. Will have deep sporting knowledge. Not just football and whatever happens to be on Sky Sports Main Event. Will be comfortable making good trading decisions when things are moving quickly. Will want to help build a sportsbook that does things differently. 💰Winnings Join us at an exciting stage as we establish our Gibraltar office. We're investing in a great local employee experience and will continue to expand our benefits package as we grow. Additional annual leave based on tenure. Get two extra days after three years at Midnite, another three after five years, and one more after eight - taking your total annual leave to 34 days Quarterly team socials to connect, celebrate and have fun together. At Midnite, we’re committed to creating equal opportunities for everyone. We actively strive to build balanced teams that reflect the diversity of our communities, including ethnic minorities, people with disabilities, the LGBTQIA+ community, and all genders. We aim to provide an inclusive and supportive interview experience for all candidates. If you require any reasonable adjustments, please let us know in advance so we can ensure you feel comfortable and set up for success. Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
