<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-uvc-partners-junior-value-creation-analyst-intern-or-working-student-munchen-kreativquartier-251770> a prov:Entity,
        schema:JobPosting ;
    dcterms:source <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/source/arbeitnow> ;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-08-22T01:26:57+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/unternehmertum-ggmbh/uvc-partners-junior-value-creation-analyst-intern-or-working-student-munchen-kreativquartier-251770> ;
    kgjobs:active true ;
    kgjobs:canonicalFingerprint "02416ccfb107d2d8e6738a64dc0b104407410715891443079d834a994d8196cb" ;
    kgjobs:classification "not_match" ;
    kgjobs:firstSeenAt "2026-08-21T22:29:31+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:lastSeenAt "2026-08-22T01:26:57+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "uvc-partners-junior-value-creation-analyst-intern-or-working-student-munchen-kreativquartier-251770" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-08-21"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "Über uns UVC Partners backs Europe’s most ambitious B2B tech founders building new category leaders with more than €800m in assets under management. From DeepTech to AI, the firm has invested in breakout startups including Isar Aerospace, Proxima Fusion, Q.ANT, Aleph Alpha, Tacto, Flix, and FINN. UVC Partners' Value Creation team is a team of experts whose core mission is to create measurable impact for our portfolio companies by giving them unique access to industry leaders through a structured, proactive approach. Deeply rooted in UnternehmerTUM, Europe's leading startup and business innovation ecosystem, the team builds actionable relationships between our portfolio companies and a network of 1,000+ corporates as potential customers and strategic partners - and turns those relationships into real business outcomes. Deine Aufgaben Value Creation is not a side show at UVC Partners. We are looking for an outstanding individual to join us to work within our Value Creation team to open doors for our startups they couldn’t open alone. What you will contribute, starting in week two: Sales Enablement – You will support our founders directly with business development topics. You research who holds the budget inside a target corporate, find the path there through our network, and write the intro email Corporate Partnerships – You prepare sessions with our industrial partners, join the room, and document what comes out of them. You will be talking to people twenty years your senior Knowledge Management – Our founders ask the same questions again and again (pricing, first sales hires, KPI reporting). You own your own topic streams and turn them into something a founder can apply in ten minutes Data Management – Our Salesforce is the memory of the fund. You keep it clean and build the analyses and AI-supported workflows that save the team hours with Claude and Notion How to apply: Please apply by uploading your CV, transcripts, and one page of max. 350 words answering all three questions below: 1. Pick one of our portfolio companies and name a concrete target customer for them. Which company, which role inside it, and how would you get to that person? Three or four sentences are enough. 2. Which technological development interests you most right now – and what speaks against it? We want the counterargument as much as the enthusiasm. 3. Which book would you give a founder in their first month, and why? No obligatory business classics. An honest answer beats an impressive one. Write it yourself. If you used AI, tell us in one sentence what for. Dein Profil You are currently enrolled in a Master's degree program with excellent results at a top-tier university - We are open to all types of educational backgrounds (e.g., engineering, science, business, finance, etc.) You have previously worked in a fast-paced environment (startups, VC/PE, consulting, or similar) You bring hands-on experience with AI tools; first experience working with Salesforce is also a plus You are deeply passionate about startups, technology, and innovation You are collaborative, empathetic, and communicative - a true team player You have a high level of intellectual curiosity as well as a self-starter and growth mindset Strong written and oral communication skills in English and German You are available for this position either full-time for 5–6 months or part-time (20h/week) for at least 12 months Deine Vorteile Ownership – You will work on your own impactful projects from day one to contribute to the growth and success of our portfolio companies Important member of the team – You will be part of the Value Creation team where you will get direct access to our outstanding founders Mentorship – Be paired with one senior member of our team with regular 1-to-1 sessions Venture Capital trainee program – Take part in the condensed apprenticeship program that gives you the details on how to excel in the venture capital industry – as an investor or a founder Free sports classes – Join our weekly, free of charge classes in the office in Munich Network – Be part of the UnternehmerTUM ecosystem to equip you with perspectives and contacts to leapfrog your startup career Sustainability – Get to know the next generation of sustainable startups that are changing the world we live in Competitive salary – You receive a competitive salary package and will have the flexibility to align your studies with our day-to-day operations Vielfalt ist uns wichtig Diversity enriches our team. We explicitly encourage all qualified individuals to apply, regardless of gender, social and ethnic background, sexual orientation, religion, age, or disability. Kontakt Unternehmertum Venture Capital Partners GmbH , c/o Munich Urban Colab, Freddie- Mercury-Straße 5, 80797 Munich, Germany www.uvcpartners.com UVC Partners is an equal opportunity employer. UVC Partners is an independent venture capital fund. For efficiency, we use certain shared services from UnternehmerTUM. This is why parts of the application process may appear UTUM-branded, and your application will be processed by UVC Partners and UnternehmerTUM. Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:employmentType "Entry, Full or part time, Working student" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-unternehmertum-ggmbh ;
    schema:identifier "arbeitnow-uvc-partners-junior-value-creation-analyst-intern-or-working-student-munchen-kreativquartier-251770" ;
    schema:jobLocation [ a schema:Place ;
            schema:name "München Kreativquartier" ] ;
    schema:title "UVC Partners: Junior Value Creation Analyst - Intern or Working Student (f/m/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/unternehmertum-ggmbh/uvc-partners-junior-value-creation-analyst-intern-or-working-student-munchen-kreativquartier-251770> .

